{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつき(｀_´)ゞ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼んー!!ななせまるっ／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/25/1848786/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"違うか。どうも、只の若月です。んーななせまるっ!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日おめでとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/25/1848786/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/25/1848786/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"94年組の18歳チームに仲間入りっすね(｀・ω・´)いいなー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月ももうすぐや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/25/1848786/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ナナセスキ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい。というわけで始まりました若月ブログ(σ*´∀｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は久々の家族ネタ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の母は謎すぎる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、母からのプレゼントで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姉と私にお揃いのワンピースを貰ったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのワンピースを着て"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二人で出掛けて、写メを撮ってメールで母に送ったんですよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その写メへの母からの返事..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『すごかわ！見たかった映像♪今日会ったんだね。かわゆす』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......謎。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごかわってはじめて聞いた。笑凄い可愛いなのか、凄い変わっているなのか...まぁきっと前者なんだろうけど...母が使うと凄い違和感。......これをすごいわと言うのだろうか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、違うか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、一番謎なのはこれ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見たかった映像ってなんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ベストハウ...((ry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みたいな言い方するなし(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"噂の姉妹でお揃い!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これだぁ〜1...２...((ry"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さらに、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年の冬に来た"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"母からの手紙がありまして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"その手紙が来た当時は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"東京に来たばかりで母からの手紙が嬉しくて、感動して部屋にすぐ飾ったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"けれど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近になって読み返したら内容がまぁ、ひどいひどい。(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ゆみ、東京はどうですか。寒くなってきましたが大丈夫ですか？お母さん、この間ゆみに洋服を買おうと思って一人で109に行ってきました!!ゆみのよく行ってた店とか回ってさ。でもやっぱりゆみがいないとわかんないねっ!!じゃ、ファイティン♪母より』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう色々と...助けて(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結論何も買ってないっていう(笑)結論何も同封されてないっていう(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただただ、やっぱり本人じゃなきゃ何もわかんなかったよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう報告だった(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"文の統一性のなさにびっくりした。最後のファイティン♪ってなんだよ(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この内容を手紙にした意味(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁそんな母が大好きだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん。昨日姉とご飯食べに行ったんだけど、こんな母のメールで爆笑でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑ってる姉も姉だけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の姉は大概集合時間ぴったりに来ることはない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、姉は学んだらしく"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『４時に集合ってつもりで支度するから、遅刻することを前提にして、ゆみは４時30分にきて！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と姉からの提案でなりました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少し早めに私は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"16時15分に集合場所へ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そこへ姉からメール。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姉にしては早い到着!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっと学んだな。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『ごめん(  ；∀；)今起きた。』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"な、なんだとぉおうおお(゜Д゜；≡；゜Д゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやぁ、もともこもないっていう言葉がこんなに合う人はそういないと思う(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"というわけで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"姉も大概ダメ人間です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"押し花とおしぼり間違えるしね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"このおしぼり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いってなんすかお姉さん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はい、以上"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月家の事情でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お母さんとお姉ちゃんが"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天然のボケ類で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お兄ちゃんと私が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つっこみ類です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くだらないブログすみません(笑)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では ばかつきぃ♪(/ω＼*)"}],"source":"archive"}